{"id":"vod_sn_37925","vodId":"37925","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"冰果","name_cn":"冰果","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/541322567963583901f37c09a598646d.jpg"},"summary":"本片是以神木高中“古典部”为舞台，围绕四个部员折木奉太郎、千反田爱瑠、福部里志、伊原摩耶花展开的校园推理剧。神木高中一年级生折木奉太郎是一个“节能”主义者，他信奉“不必要的事不做，非做不可的事就尽快解决”，过着“灰色”的高中生活。不参加任何社团的他，却因为姐姐的拜托而加入了濒临废部的“古典部”。在古典部他结识了好奇心旺盛的千金小姐千反田爱瑠，国中好友福部里志、伊原摩耶花也相继加入古典部。　　原来千反田失踪已久的舅舅就是当年古典部的部长，于是四人开始着手调查四十五年前古典部的神秘事件，而最大的线索就是当年的社刊“冰果”。冰果里隐藏了什么样的秘密，当年的部长为什么要退学……　　本动画改编自日本推理作家米泽穗信的古典部系列小说。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:56:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Dgy5RyiqAN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NRzAxztvNx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DSNq44SEwk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9jrNPauaCK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aVcEX6E0Uc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n9Y6fX3y591/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/S8bRujv7me1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h6wJw44npw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bTwULZD24C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pR0mgCuG4h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PJNuWKR7Ry1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0CNSeaAZPT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dn416TjxV11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YL638ia24K1/video/inde